## 🧪 Examples

### 🔹 Example 1: Simple Method

```java
public class Main {
  static void welcome() {
    System.out.println("my world");
  }

  public static void main(String[] args) {
    welcome();  // Method call
  }
}
```

### 🔹 Example 2: Method with Return Value

```java
class Main {
  public int addition(int p, int q) {
    return p + q;
  }

  public static void main(String[] args) {
    Main obj = new Main();
    int answer = obj.addition(40, 60);
    System.out.println("Sum is: " + answer);
  }
}
```

### 🔹 Example 3: Method with No Return

```java
class Main {
  public void addition(int p, int q) {
    int add = p + q;
    System.out.println("Sum is: " + add);
  }

  public static void main(String[] args) {
    Main obj = new Main();
    obj.addition(40, 60);
  }
}
```

